    "name": "Vectors and Two-Dimensional Projectile Motion",
    "description": "An AR lab for General Physics I that builds from vector representation and graphical addition to component decomposition, then applies these ideas to projectile motion. Learners manipulate a launch ramp to explore how horizontal and vertical velocity components evolve independently under gravity and how launch angle and speed affect trajectory, range, and maximum height.",
